Package: dev.scrcrappy.agent
Name: scrcrappy-agent
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Lets a paired computer running scrcrappy control this iPhone over USB: touch, keys and buttons, text, clipboard, screen info and screenshots. Localhost only; a new computer needs an Allow on the phone.
Maintainer: scrcrappy
Author: scrcrappy
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate | ellekit, preferenceloader
